Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:07.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:18.81,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:23.52,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:27.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:34.83,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:41.34,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.74,0:00:49.17,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.35,0:00:55.51,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.55,0:00:59.22,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.36,0:01:03.89,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.26,0:01:10.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:21.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.98,0:01:42.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚出来 椿！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:45.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是那个椿没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:47.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪一个椿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:51.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十年前和桔梗姐姐并驾齐驱的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:14.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 那个巫女是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.81,0:02:16.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是椿小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:21.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到她变成了黑巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:24.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前的事情怎样都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:26.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙现在在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.06,0:02:32.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感受到四魂之玉在这里最深处
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:33.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.56,0:02:35.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我记得这地方是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.73,0:02:38.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.73,0:02:42.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说这里曾经封印着鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.27,0:02:44.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:54.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第64话 多宝塔的巨大鬼怪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:01.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.46,0:03:07.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚出来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.30,0:03:12.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开 臭妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.47,0:03:18.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.02,0:03:33.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你醒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:35.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.79,0:03:37.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:39.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会加害你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.83,0:03:41.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:42.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何？愿意为我生孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.14,0:03:52.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何？愿意为我生孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:54.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对象是谁都可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:57.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 我不是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.31,0:03:59.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们醒过来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:02.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现了吗 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.65,0:04:04.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别靠近我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.69,0:04:07.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不应该这样子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:10.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝一直照顾着你们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:13.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个妖怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.39,0:04:15.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为戈薇吩咐我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.43,0:04:17.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能对你们两人出手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此是七宝在照顾你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:22.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是太多管闲事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:24.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙不是坏妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:26.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没有害过人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:27.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:32.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是巫女 会认为妖怪统统都是坏蛋也没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.68,0:04:34.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:36.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.62,0:04:38.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:40.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:42.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尾巴尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:44.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耳朵耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:46.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.63,0:04:49.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:54.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忍耐一下让她们了解你并不是坏妖怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:56.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真羡慕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.34,0:04:58.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 为什么袭击椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:01.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 那个叫犬夜叉的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:02.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是邪恶的坏蛋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:05.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为椿企图咒杀戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.95,0:05:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.85,0:05:07.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.08,0:05:10.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿告诉你们什么我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.85,0:05:13.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是她现在是诅咒别人的黑巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:21.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没啥大不了的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确不像是刚才颇具威力的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:30.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿的力量减弱了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:32.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是她明明有四魂之玉呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:34.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概不知道怎么使用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:46.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.19,0:05:48.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么塔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你们的葬身之地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.27,0:06:01.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:07.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿果然有与奈落联手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.27,0:06:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落也有份是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:10.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:13.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你和椿狠狠的揍一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:15.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可别太心急了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:19.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要当你们对手的不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是来看你们的死状而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.87,0:06:37.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么大不了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:40.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙也不过是人偶罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.45,0:06:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.95,0:06:50.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还挺有两下子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:53.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么这招如何
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:57.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子你不是只来看戏的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.47,0:07:08.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.77,0:07:10.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是来打发时间的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:14.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:22.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.29,0:07:31.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙蛇之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.17,0:07:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招 风刃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.37,0:07:43.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.11,0:07:50.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:04.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:17.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 接下来换你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:21.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:24.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿那边先吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.15,0:08:26.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:29.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 是四魂之玉的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.59,0:08:39.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里布下了结界 似乎曾经封印了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.09,0:08:42.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而封印已经被解开了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:43.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是刚才的式神吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.63,0:08:45.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是封印那些的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:48.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不需要这么牢固的封印的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:50.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正进去就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:51.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:02.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位椿师姐居然是黑巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:04.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种话我们才不信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:06.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两位和椿是同门弟子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:08.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会这么想是当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:11.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然你们到那里去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.26,0:09:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲眼见识真相如何
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:18.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点走吧 两位要抓紧喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:22.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道在高兴什么 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:24.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.08,0:09:37.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开启鬼之门 招来金色之神
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:56.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胆敢将我封印…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:09:58.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:10:00.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:03.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就赐给你力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉的力量在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 不想要这股力量吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:14.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我 给我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.59,0:10:18.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快给我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.98,0:10:39.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼啊 鬼的力量啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.61,0:10:42.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:45.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你了 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:47.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你们啊 我一直在等呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.16,0:10:50.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将四魂之玉还给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.46,0:10:54.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此 它的确很了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:57.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉就在椿的右眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:10:58.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,右眼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:01.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到它居然有这么强的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:03.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果五十年前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:06.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这颗四魂之玉回到我身边的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.47,0:11:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十年前？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:10.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿 你在那时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:12.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和桔梗姐姐发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.55,0:11:16.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗？桔梗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:27.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这统统都是桔梗的错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:30.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个假正经的冷酷巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:32.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本没资格说桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:33.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:35.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:40.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:44.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 妖怪接下来是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:46.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只右眼里又养了什么怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:48.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是充沛 真是充沛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.85,0:11:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丰沛的鬼之力充满我的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:57.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:05.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么门会…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.07,0:12:09.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,禁忌的多宝塔居然打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.74,0:12:11.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,禁忌的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.20,0:12:12.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:14.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:16.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:30.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:43.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是四魂之玉的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.64,0:12:46.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是鬼所拥有的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.09,0:13:01.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:04.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到我获得的力量 吓的说不出话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.99,0:13:06.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封印被打破了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:08.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:11.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是椿师姐解开封印
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:15.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有这股力量 我终于能永恒不灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:20.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个退开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:21.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.91,0:13:27.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股力量真是太美妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:33.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:47.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她竟然空手挡住铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:53.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用 没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:13:59.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.01,0:14:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.21,0:14:34.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙…竟然承受住了风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:36.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.32,0:14:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:48.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话 风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.24,0:14:59.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:16.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是桔梗转世
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.89,0:15:19.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没什么了不起的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:30.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗不过是浪费四魂之力的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:31.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:36.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我椿 才够格拥有四魂之玉的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.31,0:15:41.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:43.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫做四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:47.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肩负着去除污秽与净化它的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:54.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跨越五十年的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.83,0:15:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今四魂之玉成为我的力量了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:15:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:04.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少在那里自以为是了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:12.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:16.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更多 还要更多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:19.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉还能放入更多力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.49,0:16:24.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,渴望四魂之力的妖怪要多少有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.96,0:16:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将这些妖怪们统统吞进去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.69,0:16:29.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就能永恒不灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:31.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她想利用四魂之力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:34.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将妖怪的力量吸进身体里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.83,0:16:36.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让她得逞的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.31,0:16:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖 你也变成我的力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:48.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉！就是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.68,0:16:51.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让桔梗动心的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.89,0:16:53.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.89,0:16:56.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗无法驯服的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.69,0:16:59.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让我来调教你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:05.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.53,0:17:09.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就用四魂之玉夺走你的理智好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.04,0:17:21.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种力量有什么了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:24.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 半妖？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:27.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你没有被这股力量夺去理智
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.89,0:17:30.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你污染了四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:32.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和桔梗完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.93,0:17:34.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还敢说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:37.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:39.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:41.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为了得到这股力量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不惜将一切舍弃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:45.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 椿 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:49.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 师父 椿无法接受
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.41,0:17:51.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么四魂之玉不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:53.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是托付给桔梗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:54.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:57.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我不行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:17:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:02.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿认为自己不比桔梗差劲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.46,0:18:08.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见识一下我的力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.83,0:18:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:19.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.28,0:18:24.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.05,0:18:30.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这股妖气会要你的命
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.36,0:18:40.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧 爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:11.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:13.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.60,0:19:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:29.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.04,0:19:32.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我有这颗四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:40.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想逃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:50.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.07,0:19:56.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.07,0:19:59.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的青春渐渐流失了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.94,0:20:03.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法留住青春
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.81,0:20:05.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她竟然迅速老化了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.01,0:20:09.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同时失去妖怪与四魂之力的椿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.12,0:20:12.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能恢复原本的姿态
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.49,0:20:15.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底是哪里搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.82,0:20:17.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那半妖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个戈薇吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.13,0:20:23.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是我被奈落给耍了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底哪里…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.83,0:20:28.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:31.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不比桔梗差
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:33.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉不应该给桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.57,0:20:35.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该给我椿才对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:41.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我椿才是最厉害的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.89,0:20:53.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是黑巫女的下场
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:56.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:04.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给各位添麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.50,0:21:05.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.77,0:21:08.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不是你们两位的错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.61,0:21:09.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.14,0:21:12.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要保重喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.28,0:21:18.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果大家都被奈落的计策耍的团团转
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.72,0:21:19.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.12,0:21:22.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论是椿或我们都是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:27.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果四魂之玉 又原封不动回到奈落手上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.46,0:21:29.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对要抢回来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.13,0:21:31.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的没错 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.90,0:21:33.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经没力了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:36.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.67,0:21:42.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.91,0:21:45.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.35,0:21:46.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我多心了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.48,0:21:52.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,执着于四魂之玉的椿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.55,0:21:54.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就没有胜算可言
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:57.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,执念吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.12,0:22:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没资格说别人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.11,0:22:21.17,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.95,0:22:28.05,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.79,0:22:34.85,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:41.33,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.04,0:22:48.20,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.51,0:22:55.00,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:23:02.09,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.76,0:23:08.66,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.26,0:23:15.69,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.97,0:23:22.43,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.91,0:23:28.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.65,0:23:35.45,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.86,0:23:52.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 冥加爷爷？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.53,0:23:54.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前老是躲我们躲的远远的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.63,0:23:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天怎么逃回我们这里了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.44,0:24:00.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚竟然袭击弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.31,0:24:04.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事 犬夜叉也变得怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.54,0:24:07.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会是大蜈蚣的诅咒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.81,0:24:09.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.08,0:24:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再会了 青春岁月
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.15,0:24:14.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是指谁的青春啊？
